              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ammalle Solomonini maneeni fardooleeni isaatiifi gaarini isaa iti galu kuma afuri qaba. Ammalle fardoole askartini yaabatu kuma kud'ani lama qaba. Haga toko Yerusalemuti galche, kaani dira d'ibiti gargari qoode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
